<p>A path of sunlight appears in front of you for 5 turns. All foes standing inside take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">38, 51, 62, 70, 78</acronym> Light damage per turn.</p><p>While standing in the path, your movement takes no time and can not trigger traps.</p><p>The damage done will increase with your Spellpower.</p>